---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { company } from '../data/site';
---
<BaseLayout title="Refund Policy — UPos" description="UPos subscription cancellation and 30-day refund policy.">
  <section class="legal-hero compact"><div class="shell"><p class="kicker"><span></span> Legal</p><h1>Refund Policy</h1><p>Last updated: {company.lastUpdated}</p></div></section>
  <article class="legal-copy shell">
    <p>We want UPos to be a confident purchase. This policy explains trial, cancellation and refund options for subscriptions purchased through Paddle.</p>
    <h2>14-day free trial</h2>
    <p>You can evaluate UPos for 14 days without a payment card. The trial does not automatically become a paid subscription unless you actively complete checkout.</p>
    <h2>30-day money-back guarantee</h2>
    <p>You may request a full refund of your first subscription payment within 30 calendar days of that payment. This guarantee applies once per customer and is intended to let new customers verify that UPos fits their operation.</p>
    <h2>Renewals</h2>
    <p>You can cancel at any time before the next renewal. Cancellation takes effect at the end of the current paid term. Renewal payments are generally non-refundable, but we will consider requests made within 7 days of an unintended renewal, especially where the Service has not been materially used after renewal.</p>
    <h2>How to request a refund</h2>
    <p>Email <a href={`mailto:${company.email}?subject=Refund request`}>{company.email}</a> with your account email, transaction reference and reason for the request. We respond {company.responseTime}. Approved refunds are issued to the original payment method. Bank processing times vary.</p>
    <h2>Payment disputes and Paddle support</h2>
    <p>Paddle is the Merchant of Record for purchases and handles returns and payment support. You may also use the contact details in your Paddle receipt or the <a href="https://paddle.net/" rel="noreferrer">Paddle buyer portal</a>. This policy does not limit any mandatory rights available under applicable consumer law.</p>
    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>{company.legalName}<br/><a href={`mailto:${company.email}`}>{company.email}</a></p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
